   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 68,
   "line": "Ketil hands you a bucket and nods at the door."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S2",
   "a": 68,
   "b": 92,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 24,
   "line": "Water."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S3",
   "a": 92,
   "b": 174,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 82,
   "line": "You step outside in your hoodie and your sneakers. The"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S4",
   "a": 174,
   "b": 226,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 52,
   "line": "air hits you like a wall. You"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S5",
   "a": 226,
   "b": 312,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 86,
   "line": "breathe in, and the inside of your nose freezes."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S6",
   "a": 312,
   "b": 460,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 148,
   "line": "That's real. At minus thirty, the moisture in your nose turns to ice in seconds."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S7",
   "a": 460,
   "b": 495,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 35,
   "line": "Watch the number."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S8",
   "a": 495,
   "b": 634,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 139,
   "line": "At minus thirty, skin that's left bare can freeze in ten to thirty minutes."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S9",
   "a": 634,
   "b": 712,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 78,
   "line": "Add a little wind, and it's under ten. You"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S10",
   "a": 712,
   "b": 791,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 79,
   "line": "last about forty seconds before you run back in."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S11",
   "a": 791,
   "b": 887,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 96,
   "line": "Gudrun sighs, and dresses you like you're five."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S12",
   "a": 887,
   "b": 974,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 87,
   "line": "First, a long linen shirt against your skin."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S13",
   "a": 974,
   "b": 1014,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 40,
   "line": "Then a wool tunic."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S14",
   "a": 1014,
   "b": 1062,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 48,
   "line": "Wool trousers. Wool"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S15",
   "a": 1062,
   "b": 1170,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 108,
   "line": "wrapped tight around your legs, from ankle to knee. Wool"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S16",
   "a": 1170,
   "b": 1325,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 155,
   "line": "socks made with one needle, a technique called needle binding that the Vikings used."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S17",
   "a": 1325,
   "b": 1379,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 54,
   "line": "Mittens, the same way."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S18",
   "a": 1379,
   "b": 1422,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 43,
   "line": "Wool is the secret."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S19",
   "a": 1422,
   "b": 1611,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 189,
   "line": "It can soak up about a third of its own weight in water before it even feels wet, and it keeps you warm while it does."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S20",
   "a": 1611,
   "b": 1714,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 103,
   "line": "Cotton, like your hoodie, does the opposite. Then a"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S21",
   "a": 1714,
   "b": 1808,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 94,
   "line": "heavy wool cloak, pinned at the shoulder with a brooch."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S22",
   "a": 1808,
   "b": 1838,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 30,
   "line": "A fur hat."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S23",
   "a": 1838,
   "b": 1927,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 89,
   "line": "Leather shoes, which Asa stuffs with dry grass,"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S24",
   "a": 1927,
   "b": 1952,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 25,
   "line": "giggling."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S25",
   "a": 1952,
   "b": 2040,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 88,
   "line": "The grass traps air and soaks up sweat."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S26",
   "a": 2040,
   "b": 2127,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 87,
   "line": "People in the North did this for hundreds of years."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S27",
   "a": 2127,
   "b": 2181,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 54,
   "line": "You step outside again. The"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S28",
   "a": 2181,
   "b": 2221,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 40,
   "line": "cold is still there."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S29",
   "a": 2221,
   "b": 2319,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 98,
   "line": "But now it's outside the clothes, and you're inside them. The"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S30",
   "a": 2319,
   "b": 2355,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 36,
   "line": "well is frozen."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S31",
   "a": 2355,
   "b": 2430,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 75,
   "line": "Ketil smashes the ice with an axe. You"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S32",
   "a": 2430,
   "b": 2472,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 42,
   "line": "fill the bucket. Then"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S33",
   "a": 2472,
   "b": 2512,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 40,
   "line": "you haul firewood. A"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S34",
   "a": 2512,
   "b": 2552,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 40,
   "line": "lot of firewood."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S35",
   "a": 2552,
   "b": 2636,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 84,
   "line": "A farm like this burns through a mountain of it every winter, and every"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S36",
   "a": 2636,
   "b": 2685,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 49,
   "line": "log was cut by hand."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S37",
   "a": 2685,
   "b": 2744,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 59,
   "line": "And you have to do all of it fast."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S38",
   "a": 2744,
   "b": 2836,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 92,
   "line": "Because in January, this far north, the sun is only up for about"
  },
